title: "Machine Learning Prediction of Absence of Formal Healthcare Seeking for Acutely Ill Children in Sub-Saharan Africa: A 38-Country IECV Codebase"
version: 1.0.0
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.10892345
date-released: 2026-09-24
url: "https://github.com/pediatric-ml-unmet-need/ssa-dhs-iecv"
