abstract: >-
  Complete, leak-free reproducible codebase for extracting, harmonizing, modeling,
  and evaluating machine learning models predicting the absence of formal healthcare
  seeking for acutely ill children under 5 across 38 sub-Saharan African nations
  using Demographic and Health Surveys (DHS) microdata. Implements 5-fold stratified
  cross-validation, 38-country leave-one-country-out internal-external cross-validation (IECV),
  SHAP TreeExplainer explainability, and eight prespecified sensitivity analyses.
